  "result": "**75,000:** Only one **Director** may approve it (FR-002, the 50,000.01 to 500,000.00 band). A Manager cannot.\n\n**600,000:** It needs **two approvals by two different users** (FR-003):\n1. The first must be a **Manager or Director**. It is recorded as `FirstApprovedBy`/`FirstApprovedAt`, and the invoice stays `PendingApproval`.\n2. The second must be a **Director**. Only this sets `Approved`, `DecidedBy` and `DecidedAt`.\n\nThe same user cannot count as both approvers (FR-004).\n\nI took these rules from the summary table in `AGENTS.md`. The `specs/001-approval-limits/` folder that it names is not in this checkout, so I could not check the rules against the spec itself.",
